WEBVTT

00:11.344 --> 00:12.846
[gentle, poignant music playing]

00:20.478 --> 00:22.480
[heavy breathing]

00:24.941 --> 00:26.067
[Si-eun] What I have to do…

00:28.653 --> 00:30.572
I have to catch everybody…

00:31.156 --> 00:32.824
[muffled shouting]

00:32.907 --> 00:34.868
…if they start to go over the cliff.

00:36.619 --> 00:41.124
I mean, if they're running
and they don't look where they're going…

00:48.423 --> 00:50.842
I have to come out from somewhere
and catch them.

01:01.770 --> 01:03.313
[heavy breathing echoing]

01:06.232 --> 01:09.611
[Si-eun] That's all I'd do all day.

01:13.990 --> 01:15.867
[heavy breathing echoing]

01:21.748 --> 01:23.750
["Hero" by Meego playing]

01:39.891 --> 01:45.063
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

02:40.034 --> 02:41.703
[exhales]

02:41.786 --> 02:43.788
[emotional music playing]

02:48.209 --> 02:49.878
You really are a psycho.

02:54.215 --> 02:56.759
You should understand me, Si-eun-a.

03:07.061 --> 03:08.730
[breathing shakily]

03:20.575 --> 03:22.911
THURSDAY 26 OCTOBER

03:25.663 --> 03:26.873
[sighs]

03:27.874 --> 03:29.876
[breathing shakily]

03:32.295 --> 03:34.923
[woman] Why do you think
you're unable to sleep well?

03:37.967 --> 03:40.303
You said that you were
having the same dream.

03:42.055 --> 03:45.600
Do you still…
not want to tell me what the dream is?

03:51.272 --> 03:53.024
Dreams don't really matter.

04:01.866 --> 04:03.701
Do the sleeping pills work for you?

04:06.871 --> 04:07.872
Yeah.

04:08.665 --> 04:11.501
Hmm… Is that the truth, Si-eun?

04:15.463 --> 04:18.675
Well, I'll let your mother know
they're working.

04:20.718 --> 04:21.719
Doctor?

04:23.137 --> 04:24.138
Yes?

04:26.474 --> 04:28.643
I think I'm done with this session today.

04:32.647 --> 04:34.399
[poignant music playing]

04:36.693 --> 04:37.944
[door opens]

04:53.876 --> 04:55.878
[lively chatter]

04:58.715 --> 05:00.091
[horn honks]

05:03.594 --> 05:05.596
[horn playing "La Cucaracha"]

05:10.018 --> 05:12.020
[overlapping chatter]

05:25.366 --> 05:28.953
[boy 1] Hey, look, I'm serious. I'll
really kick it this time. Watch, watch.

05:29.037 --> 05:30.496
- [boy 2 yelps]
- [students cheer]

05:30.580 --> 05:31.873
- Yeah!
- [laughter]

05:31.956 --> 05:33.207
You got him!

05:33.291 --> 05:34.417
[boy 2] Are you okay?

05:34.500 --> 05:36.461
- [boy 3] Nice kick, bro!
- [boy 4] Did you see that?

05:36.544 --> 05:39.672
- [boy 4] That was so hardcore.
- [boy 5] My throw was better than yours.

05:40.840 --> 05:42.550
- What?
- Hey, Yeon Si-eun.

05:43.426 --> 05:45.053
Hey. Let him through.

05:51.768 --> 05:52.769
Who's that?

05:54.645 --> 05:57.231
[boy 1] I heard he transferred here
after killing some kid.

05:58.608 --> 06:01.110
Even that ass Choi Hyo-man chickened out
and didn't mess with him.

06:01.194 --> 06:03.196
[laughter and chatter]

06:04.113 --> 06:06.449
[boy 6] Wow, he must be
a freaking psychopath.

06:06.532 --> 06:08.785
- Yeah, I think so…
- [boy 1] Hey, hey, hey, hey. Shut up.

06:08.868 --> 06:11.913
- [coughs] It's Yeon Si-eun.
- [boy 7] But what about this guy?

06:11.996 --> 06:14.499
Watch your mouth, bro.
He might kill someone again.

06:15.333 --> 06:17.085
[boy 8] Hey. Let's go for a smoke.

06:18.211 --> 06:20.213
[boy 9] Fuck this, man. This is too scary.

06:21.464 --> 06:26.302
"I'D JUST BE
THE CATCHER IN THE RYE AND ALL."

06:26.386 --> 06:29.639
THE CATCHER IN THE RYE
BY J.D. SALINGER

06:29.680 --> 06:31.682
[bag jingling]

06:33.393 --> 06:34.477
[music stops]

06:34.560 --> 06:35.645
[boy 10] Oh.

06:36.813 --> 06:38.439
[boy 11] Jun-tae is fucking screwed.

06:42.068 --> 06:43.319
I… I'm sorry. I, um…

06:44.737 --> 06:47.490
I was kind of in a rush,
and I bumped you by mistake.

06:58.251 --> 07:00.253
[dynamic music playing]

07:05.216 --> 07:08.386
[boy 12] Another shift, Jun-tae?
You're busy today!

07:10.805 --> 07:12.140
[boy 13] Deliveries!

07:27.572 --> 07:28.573
[boy 15] Nice!

07:30.241 --> 07:31.617
[snoring softly]

07:36.205 --> 07:38.416
I grabbed whatever, and
smashed the guy right on his head…

07:38.499 --> 07:40.460
- [boy 15] Seo Jun-tae!
- Yes?

07:43.504 --> 07:46.174
You were supposed to get
me strawberry milk.

07:47.175 --> 07:48.885
- Huh?
- [students whispering]

07:48.968 --> 07:50.553
[boy 15] Hey, you little bitch.

07:50.636 --> 07:54.474
I told you to switch it up last week,
so why didn't you listen?

07:55.057 --> 07:55.892
Ah.

08:00.438 --> 08:01.689
S… strawberry.

08:04.484 --> 08:05.860
What's with the face?

08:07.904 --> 08:10.031
[scoffs] Too hard for you?

08:10.823 --> 08:14.202
Um… I… I'm sorry.
I had a brain fart for a second.

08:15.828 --> 08:17.622
I'll let it pass just this once.

08:18.873 --> 08:19.874
Hmm?

08:21.626 --> 08:22.627
Come on.

08:24.045 --> 08:26.547
I'm sorry.
I'll pay more attention next time.

08:26.631 --> 08:29.800
[boy 15] Okay. Good.
Bring your collected stuff later.

08:32.053 --> 08:33.304
iPhones.

08:34.013 --> 08:35.056
iPhones.

08:35.556 --> 08:36.474
[boy 15] Beat it.

08:38.017 --> 08:40.228
[boy 16] Ah, Jun-tae is so freaking cute.

08:40.311 --> 08:42.813
[boy 17] Keep it up, Jun-tae!
He's like a puppy.

09:02.542 --> 09:06.629
11TH GRADE, CLASS 4 PHONE COLLECTION TABLE

09:11.050 --> 09:12.134
YEON SI-EUN

09:12.218 --> 09:13.469
[Jun-tae] "Yeon Si-eun."

09:16.138 --> 09:18.724
TRANSFERRED LAST YEAR
NOT TO BE MESSED WITH

09:25.523 --> 09:27.191
It's right there, look!

09:28.734 --> 09:29.694
What?

09:30.945 --> 09:32.321
Oh! It does.

09:43.124 --> 09:44.041
[Jun-tae] Yeon Si-eun.

09:47.587 --> 09:48.713
Uh, hi.

09:50.131 --> 09:52.967
Um, I was wondering
what kind of phone you have.

09:54.802 --> 09:55.803
What?

09:56.596 --> 09:58.472
Oh, n… nothing, just, um…

09:59.181 --> 10:02.977
I was wondering if you could tell me
what kind of phone you're using right now.

10:03.060 --> 10:04.145
I'm curious.

10:06.147 --> 10:06.981
Why?

10:09.317 --> 10:10.985
Just… no reason.

10:15.990 --> 10:17.450
[sighs]

10:19.535 --> 10:21.203
WELCOME TO THE WORLD OF GO
EUNJANG BOARDROOM

10:21.287 --> 10:22.538
[boy] Ouch. Ouch. Take it easy!

10:24.123 --> 10:25.916
[Hyo-man] Fuck, is this everything?

10:27.251 --> 10:28.419
[sighs]

10:29.545 --> 10:32.965
Seems like you keep bringing me
less and less. Huh?

10:35.509 --> 10:36.802
[tuts] Meh.

10:37.428 --> 10:38.596
Fuck this.

10:43.517 --> 10:48.230
Everyone, I think
you all have the wrong idea.

10:48.314 --> 10:52.109
Do you? Everyone,
this is a fucking business we have here.

10:52.193 --> 10:54.028
A business. Yeah?

10:54.111 --> 10:56.447
You need to all start
working your asses off

10:56.530 --> 10:59.200
in order for me to keep you
safe here at Eunjang High.

10:59.283 --> 11:00.451
Get it?

11:00.951 --> 11:02.244
[boy 1 whimpering]

11:02.328 --> 11:06.582
[Hyo-man] But if your fucking performance
keeps dropping like this,

11:07.083 --> 11:09.960
there's no reason for me
to keep protecting you guys.

11:10.836 --> 11:13.964
[sighs] Chief Seo,
today you need to open the books.

11:14.048 --> 11:15.383
Show me that, yeah?

11:15.466 --> 11:19.679
If there's even one thing missing, you're
all going to get a freakin' beating today.

11:19.762 --> 11:20.638
[chuckles]

11:20.721 --> 11:22.682
- The… the book.
- [Hyo-man] Five. Four.

11:23.265 --> 11:26.060
- Three, come on. Two.
- [bully 1] Jun-tae-ya, be quick about it.

11:26.602 --> 11:28.437
- [Hyo-man] Ugh…
- [Jun-tae sighs]

11:28.521 --> 11:32.316
Wait, Chief Seo.
This looks like an important note here.

11:32.400 --> 11:35.611
- What do you mean?
- [Hyo-man] I mean, look at this.

11:36.654 --> 11:38.823
"Classroom Four,
Yeon Si-eun, not to be messed with."

11:38.906 --> 11:40.491
Not to be messed with?

11:41.200 --> 11:42.118
[scoffs]

11:42.201 --> 11:43.828
- Why not?
- [sighs]

11:43.911 --> 11:47.373
Well… well, the thing is that, um…

11:47.456 --> 11:51.544
When he transferred here,
he almost got into a fight with you,

11:51.627 --> 11:54.964
but then everything was called off
when the teacher walked in.

11:55.047 --> 11:56.215
You told everyone.

11:56.799 --> 12:00.511
You said you'd take care of him yourself,
so nobody else should override you.

12:00.594 --> 12:02.513
- Get to the point. Hurry up.
- [Jun-tae] Yes, okay.

12:02.596 --> 12:04.390
Y… you haven't taken any measures yet,

12:04.473 --> 12:08.978
so I thought that if I would've
made a decision and moved ahead,

12:09.061 --> 12:10.938
it could create a problem

12:11.021 --> 12:13.607
- Problem, huh?
- [bully 1 scoffs] A problem.

12:13.691 --> 12:14.942
[bully 2] This crazy kid.

12:15.025 --> 12:16.527
[scoffs] Problem, huh?

12:16.610 --> 12:17.862
[laughs]

12:17.945 --> 12:20.448
[bully 2] Stupid kid
just pushed the worst button.

12:23.534 --> 12:25.661
- What problem is that?
- I… I misspoke, I think.

12:25.745 --> 12:27.830
[Hyo-man] So, by this so-called "problem,"

12:27.913 --> 12:31.500
do you mean my ass is gonna
get owned by that little shit?

12:31.584 --> 12:33.127
- No. No.
- Is that what you really meant?

12:33.210 --> 12:34.462
Stop denying it, you bitch!

12:34.545 --> 12:35.588
You know how to block?

12:36.422 --> 12:39.175
Hey, that was pretty cool, man.
Do it again, keep going.

12:43.220 --> 12:44.054
Attention.

12:45.222 --> 12:46.390
[grunts]

12:48.684 --> 12:50.561
You must've kept that
to yourself for a while.

12:50.644 --> 12:52.688
That I'd lose, you stupid piece of shit!

12:52.772 --> 12:55.441
Right? Right? Hey! Hey! Hey!

12:55.941 --> 12:57.401
[Jun-tae whimpers]

12:58.527 --> 12:59.695
[Hyo-man] Get up.

12:59.779 --> 13:01.530
- Okay?
- [laughing]

13:01.614 --> 13:03.032
[boy 2 whimpers]

13:03.115 --> 13:04.450
[coughs]

13:05.242 --> 13:08.329
[Hyo-man] This kid looks hella fucked up.
You a beggar or what?

13:08.412 --> 13:11.749
You need to look sharp in your uniform.
Who did this to you, huh?

13:14.001 --> 13:15.169
[sighs]

13:15.252 --> 13:16.212
Sweep the leg.

13:16.796 --> 13:17.838
[bully 1] Oh, yeah!

13:18.506 --> 13:20.216
[bully 2] You nailed him!

13:20.299 --> 13:21.467
Oh, fuck.

13:21.550 --> 13:23.010
[laughing]

13:25.304 --> 13:26.430
[Hyo-man] Chief Seo.

13:26.514 --> 13:28.057
[Jun-tae trembling]

13:29.225 --> 13:30.684
I'll trust you.

13:30.768 --> 13:33.270
Bring Yeon Si-eun's punk-ass phone
to me today.

13:33.813 --> 13:35.397
- Okay.
- [boy 1 whimpers]

13:35.481 --> 13:36.941
[Hyo-man] Great, thank you.

13:38.400 --> 13:39.819
[boy 2 sobbing]

13:40.778 --> 13:43.656
[teacher] Both of you still
haven't done your homework?

13:43.739 --> 13:46.367
- These kids. They never listen.
- [PA chiming]

13:47.576 --> 13:49.411
Sir, I'm here for the phones.

13:49.495 --> 13:52.122
Huh? There's no ending announcement today.

13:52.915 --> 13:54.959
- See you tomorrow.
- Uh-huh. Great.

13:56.168 --> 13:58.170
[loud chatter outside]

13:59.255 --> 14:00.589
[Jun-tae] I can't help it.

14:01.924 --> 14:03.926
[suspenseful music playing]

14:05.261 --> 14:06.929
[Jun-tae] I have no other choice.

14:18.899 --> 14:20.025
[sighs]

14:21.235 --> 14:22.778
[breathing shakily]

14:26.073 --> 14:30.995
12 - YEON SI-EUN

14:31.078 --> 14:32.872
- [boy 1] Uh-huh?
- [boy 2] That's really…

14:32.955 --> 14:34.957
Yeah. Why don't you fly through Seoul?

14:35.457 --> 14:37.835
Let's hurry and get our phones. Then…

14:37.918 --> 14:39.128
- We'll stay and…
- [boy 1] Deal.

14:39.211 --> 14:41.714
Guys, take your phones.
There's no roll call today.

14:41.797 --> 14:43.507
[cheering and yelling]

14:54.268 --> 14:55.394
[boy 2] Hey, wait for me.

15:03.068 --> 15:03.986
[Si-eun] Hey.

15:05.613 --> 15:06.614
[Jun-tae] Huh?

15:07.406 --> 15:08.449
Why is my phone missing?

15:11.285 --> 15:12.745
Oh, your phone's not there?

15:14.413 --> 15:15.289
It's missing.

15:17.708 --> 15:19.251
Oh, really? [chuckles]

15:19.335 --> 15:21.962
Oh. Well, that's really weird, right?

15:22.046 --> 15:24.757
[laughs] Where did it go? How…

15:24.840 --> 15:26.300
Could it… It's not…

15:26.800 --> 15:27.927
It really isn't there.

15:28.010 --> 15:30.930
Oh, whoa. Wow, so strange.

15:31.013 --> 15:33.891
I just collected them
from the teachers' office.

15:33.974 --> 15:36.518
It's not like
I passed them out to everyone.

15:36.602 --> 15:38.771
You saw, right?
Everyone took their own phones.

15:38.854 --> 15:43.317
It'd be impossible for me to put my hands
on, look, or steal a… anyone's phone.

15:43.400 --> 15:45.903
[chuckles] I'm not a beggar or anything.

15:45.986 --> 15:48.447
[laughs nervously] Yeah.

15:49.406 --> 15:50.908
You know what I mean, right?

15:54.578 --> 15:56.622
No, I don't know what you meant at all.

15:57.414 --> 15:58.290
Um…

16:00.292 --> 16:02.419
Anyway, I have no idea
where your phone is.

16:02.503 --> 16:03.587
Okay.

16:06.340 --> 16:08.342
[footsteps retreating]

16:14.723 --> 16:16.517
[Jun-tae] Here. It's Yeon Si-eun's.

16:16.600 --> 16:18.352
[bully 1] I knew you'd do it, Chief Seo.

16:18.435 --> 16:20.729
Why'd it take him getting mad
for you to do it?

16:20.813 --> 16:22.606
You should've taken initiative.

16:23.232 --> 16:25.275
Clock out. I'll give this to Hyo-man.

16:26.485 --> 16:28.404
- Okay.
- [bully 2] Get home safe, Jun-tae.

16:28.487 --> 16:29.822
- Thanks.
- [bully 2 sniffs]

16:30.906 --> 16:31.907
Bye now.

16:33.283 --> 16:34.493
Love you, Jun-tae.

16:39.915 --> 16:41.458
[sighs]

16:48.924 --> 16:51.093
Hey, Si-eun. Did you find your phone?

17:05.816 --> 17:07.985
Uh… I, uh…

17:08.902 --> 17:10.320
I've been thinking.

17:10.404 --> 17:12.072
I've been feeling kind of bad.

17:12.698 --> 17:15.826
Well, some regrets. [chuckles]

17:15.909 --> 17:20.122
Because I'm partially responsible
for your missing phone.

17:20.205 --> 17:23.292
So if you're planning to get a new phone,

17:23.375 --> 17:25.627
I can chip in some of the money.

17:26.503 --> 17:30.507
Hey, this is the time for you to remain
positive and keep pushing forward, right?

17:30.591 --> 17:32.259
Anyway, as you may already know,

17:32.342 --> 17:34.595
some things
are kind of inevitable in life.

17:34.678 --> 17:35.846
What's inevitable?

17:39.016 --> 17:40.893
You actually think I'm that dense?

17:44.021 --> 17:46.190
You're just doing this to find your peace.

17:51.153 --> 17:53.280
You're just being a coward. Okay?

17:58.077 --> 17:59.286
Uh… uh…

18:00.579 --> 18:02.581
[poignant music playing]

18:09.797 --> 18:11.090
Being a coward?

18:14.301 --> 18:15.177
[Si-eun's mother] Hey.

18:15.844 --> 18:18.430
Did you lose your phone
on purpose to get a new one?

18:21.975 --> 18:24.144
[sighs] This is so nice.

18:24.228 --> 18:26.730
My son and I getting some quality time.

18:28.273 --> 18:31.193
Oh, next semester you're studying abroad,

18:31.276 --> 18:34.321
so we won't be able to spend
time like this for a while.

18:36.406 --> 18:39.910
It'll be tough at first,
but you'll get used to it soon.

18:41.745 --> 18:43.747
[poignant music playing]

18:57.469 --> 18:58.637
[Si-eun] Su-ho-ya.

19:01.765 --> 19:03.100
I still can't sleep.

19:04.476 --> 19:06.145
SUNGANG UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL

19:06.228 --> 19:07.771
Even with sleeping pills,

19:09.314 --> 19:10.774
I can't fall asleep.

19:15.571 --> 19:17.406
There's no way I can fall asleep.

19:17.489 --> 19:19.491
[monitor bleeping]

19:19.575 --> 19:20.868
[ventilator hissing]

19:20.951 --> 19:22.661
[Si-eun] When are you going to wake up?

19:26.790 --> 19:27.875
A few days ago,

19:29.710 --> 19:31.962
I called one of my classmates a coward.

19:34.590 --> 19:35.591
But…

19:39.011 --> 19:41.180
I'm more of a coward than he is.

19:44.600 --> 19:45.601
I just…

19:48.145 --> 19:50.355
want everyone to leave me alone.

19:53.442 --> 19:54.443
As if

19:56.111 --> 19:57.321
I don't exist.

19:59.531 --> 20:01.533
[overlapping chatter]

20:04.328 --> 20:05.454
[boy 1] Hey, let's just go.

20:07.956 --> 20:10.584
- [boy 2] Why is he doing this?
- [Hyo-man] Nice job. You did great.

20:10.667 --> 20:13.253
You're such a little cutie. Right?

20:13.337 --> 20:15.339
Hug me really tight, little guy. Huh?

20:15.422 --> 20:17.716
My little Jun-tae.
Wanna go on a blind date?

20:17.799 --> 20:20.719
- What do you think?
- Yeah. Hey, come out with us for a drink.

20:20.802 --> 20:23.889
That sounds great.
Our puppy Jun-tae has a big dick.

20:23.972 --> 20:25.182
[Hyo-man] Really?

20:25.265 --> 20:28.435
No way, man.
My precious Jun-tae has a big one?

20:28.518 --> 20:30.437
- [chuckles] Not really.
- Let me feel your hot dog!

20:30.520 --> 20:32.231
- Okay? Here, come here.
- [Jun-tae] Uh… uh…

20:32.314 --> 20:35.108
- [Hyo-man] You little brat! We're friends!
- [Jun-tae] Please stop.

20:35.192 --> 20:37.361
- [bully 1] He's getting hard!
- [Hyo-man] Let me touch it.

20:37.444 --> 20:39.446
[laughter echoing]

20:40.489 --> 20:42.074
- Oh, man!
- [bully 1] Hey, you little shit!

20:42.157 --> 20:43.492
- Hey.
- [Hyo-man] Get in attention.

20:43.575 --> 20:45.953
- Hold him. Get in attention!
- [bully 2] Stop fighting.

20:46.036 --> 20:47.871
- [bully 1] He's getting hard.
- [Hyo-man] Look!

20:47.955 --> 20:50.040
- [bully 1] Look, look!
- [Jun-tae] Stop it. Stop.

20:50.123 --> 20:52.459
- [bully 2] Look at his face. [laughs]
- [Jun-tae whimpers]

20:52.542 --> 20:55.420
- [Hyo-man] Look at it. It's long!
- [bully 1] You're freaking huge, huh?

20:55.504 --> 20:57.005
[Jun-tae] Please don't.

20:57.089 --> 20:59.591
- [bully 1] Hey, Jun-tae.
- [Jun-tae] Stop it. No, stop it.

20:59.675 --> 21:00.842
[bully 1, laughing] Jun-tae!

21:01.677 --> 21:03.679
[tense, nervy music playing]

21:13.855 --> 21:14.940
[yells]

21:17.693 --> 21:18.735
[screams]

21:19.236 --> 21:21.029
- Hey, wait, wait, wait!
- [breathing shakily]

21:21.780 --> 21:24.366
- [squelch]
- [Hyo-man screams]

21:25.534 --> 21:27.536
[Hyo-man] Hey, Si-eun. Hey.

21:29.663 --> 21:30.497
Hey, man!

21:32.499 --> 21:35.752
Why the hell are you standing there?
You're fucking scary.

21:38.547 --> 21:39.923
[sighs]

21:40.007 --> 21:42.050
I heard about you losing your phone, man.

21:42.134 --> 21:44.303
A lot of phones have gone missing lately.

21:44.386 --> 21:46.680
He should take better care if it,
right, Jun-tae-ya?

21:46.763 --> 21:47.764
Huh.

21:47.848 --> 21:50.434
I happen to have a lot of extra phones.
You want one?

21:50.517 --> 21:52.686
Say, "I want a phone."

21:52.769 --> 21:54.187
[bullies laughing]

21:55.856 --> 21:58.150
Move aside. You're in my way.

21:59.318 --> 22:00.652
[Hyo-man tuts]

22:01.820 --> 22:03.947
[sighs heavily]

22:04.031 --> 22:05.949
[tense music playing]

22:06.033 --> 22:07.034
I don't care.

22:17.586 --> 22:19.087
His eyes might pop out of his head.

22:19.171 --> 22:20.422
Man, all right.

22:20.505 --> 22:22.966
Let this guy go through. Hurry and go.

22:30.432 --> 22:32.434
[breathing shakily]

22:32.517 --> 22:34.436
[bully 2] Did you see
how he fucking stared?

22:35.270 --> 22:36.897
You gonna let him do that?

22:36.980 --> 22:39.733
[Hyo-man] Nah, just leave
that loser alone. Fuck.

22:51.161 --> 22:52.204
[Jun-tae] Oh.

22:52.996 --> 22:53.997
Sorry.

22:56.166 --> 22:57.667
I didn't mean to wake you.

23:00.545 --> 23:01.671
I… I'm sorry.

23:05.634 --> 23:07.636
And, well,

23:08.887 --> 23:13.558
I got you those because you always
sleep through lunch instead of eating.

23:13.642 --> 23:15.394
I don't want them. Take 'em back.

23:17.604 --> 23:19.815
We… well, I just… [sighs]

23:21.858 --> 23:22.859
Right.

23:24.861 --> 23:25.862
I'm sorry, I…

23:25.946 --> 23:27.239
[sighs]

23:27.322 --> 23:29.491
…stole your phone and gave it to Hyo-man.

23:33.829 --> 23:35.080
I'm sorry, but

23:36.415 --> 23:38.291
I didn't have any other choice.

23:41.586 --> 23:42.587
Si-eun.

23:55.100 --> 23:56.560
Last time, you said…

23:58.562 --> 24:00.355
I was being a coward.

24:02.691 --> 24:04.818
I thought a lot about what you said.

24:08.447 --> 24:10.740
I'm not really sure
what I can do about it.

24:12.367 --> 24:14.035
- [sighs]
- So what?

24:18.874 --> 24:20.667
Will you teach me how to…

24:22.544 --> 24:24.337
[emotional music playing]

24:26.756 --> 24:29.217
Will you teach me how to not be a coward?

24:33.388 --> 24:34.473
Why should I?

24:36.850 --> 24:39.352
I thought you might be
the only person I could ask.

24:42.981 --> 24:43.982
Please.

24:46.067 --> 24:47.194
[sighs]

24:50.614 --> 24:52.782
Do you know about Newton's third law?

24:56.119 --> 24:57.370
Without any action,

24:58.413 --> 25:00.081
there won't be a reaction.

25:25.106 --> 25:26.316
[sighs]

25:27.901 --> 25:28.944
NEWTON'S LAWS OF MOTION

25:33.198 --> 25:35.033
VICE PRESIDENT

25:37.327 --> 25:39.329
[phone buzzing]

25:42.374 --> 25:43.208
[sighs]

25:48.463 --> 25:50.006
- Cheers, everybody!
- [bully 1] Hey!

25:50.090 --> 25:52.175
- [bully 2] Have a drink!
- [all] Cheers!

25:53.176 --> 25:55.178
[hip-hop music playing]

25:55.887 --> 25:56.930
Hey, Hyo-man.

25:57.013 --> 25:58.932
Seo Jun-tae's not picking up his phone.

25:59.015 --> 26:01.434
Yeah, I also heard he left early today.
Wonder why.

26:01.518 --> 26:03.103
No fucking idea. [sighs]

26:03.186 --> 26:05.605
Who's going to pay
if Jun-tae won't pick up?

26:05.689 --> 26:07.607
[sighs] You call yourselves men?

26:09.150 --> 26:10.860
[bully 1] What's this?

26:10.944 --> 26:12.404
What's "what's this?"

26:12.862 --> 26:14.281
[all cheer]

26:14.364 --> 26:17.325
- Yo, Hyo-man, you been holding out on us!
- Ballin'!

26:17.409 --> 26:19.327
Ah, I have another engagement.

26:19.828 --> 26:22.163
I gotta go, so drink more. Bye!

26:22.247 --> 26:24.916
- Where are you going?
- Business. I have business.

26:25.000 --> 26:26.918
- All right? Ah, this is great.
- [bully 2] Okay.

26:27.002 --> 26:29.087
- I'll take good care of your girl.
- [Hyo-man] Fuck you.

26:29.170 --> 26:30.839
- Where is he going?
- Want a shot?

26:30.922 --> 26:32.382
- That sounds good.
- Can you handle it?

26:32.465 --> 26:35.051
- [girl 2] Yes.
- We're trying to get into the Union.

26:35.135 --> 26:37.512
We're gonna be able to make
a shit ton of money once we join.

26:37.596 --> 26:38.597
Right now?

26:39.431 --> 26:40.974
[horn blares]

26:44.811 --> 26:47.063
[boy 1] Oh, fuck. Why don't you get it?

26:47.939 --> 26:50.650
If you go to Eunjang, you should be
a good Eunjang kid and listen.

26:50.734 --> 26:54.279
- [boy 2] Stop frowning.
- [boy 3] God, you fuckin' morons.

26:55.155 --> 26:56.031
[laughter]

26:56.114 --> 26:58.491
- [boy 1] Whoa. He's freaking loaded.
- [boy 4] He must be rich.

26:58.575 --> 27:01.286
[boy 5] This punk-ass is
freakin' loaded. Hey.

27:02.495 --> 27:03.580
Think this sucks?

27:03.663 --> 27:05.749
If you do, you can just join the Union.

27:06.791 --> 27:10.128
You all live like this because
you still go to Eunjang, you idiots.

27:10.211 --> 27:11.713
Get a grip, will you?

27:11.796 --> 27:13.798
[boy 4] I would've already transferred
if I were you.

27:13.882 --> 27:15.759
[boy 5] Hey, smile a little.

27:19.638 --> 27:20.639
What?

27:20.722 --> 27:22.015
Is Seong-je inside?

27:23.642 --> 27:24.684
What?

27:25.268 --> 27:27.270
I'm Choi Hyo-man of Eunjang High.

27:27.354 --> 27:30.023
I was supposed to meet Seong-je today.
Is he in there?

27:31.107 --> 27:32.442
- Right.
- He's in.

27:33.151 --> 27:36.112
- Yeah, Seong-je hyeong's in there.
- [Hyo-man] Ah, thank you.

27:36.946 --> 27:37.781
Hey.

27:40.325 --> 27:41.701
Give 'em what they want.

27:43.411 --> 27:44.496
[boy 5 sighs]

27:45.955 --> 27:48.792
[boy 1] What was that?
Eunjang's really joining the Union?

27:48.875 --> 27:52.295
[boy 6] But isn't Baku Eunjang's top dog?
What the hell is he doing here?

27:52.379 --> 27:53.713
[arcade machines jangling]

27:53.797 --> 27:55.090
[Hyo-man clears throat]

28:00.095 --> 28:02.430
Okay, I'll bring more supplies next month.

28:03.181 --> 28:04.391
Sure. Get lost.

28:12.774 --> 28:13.942
DAEHYEON HIGH, GANGHAK HIGH

28:14.025 --> 28:15.694
[Hyo-man] Whoa, man. That's a lot.

28:18.780 --> 28:21.282
Seong-je? It's me, Hyo-man. [chuckles]

28:22.742 --> 28:25.120
- Playing a game?
- You fucking idiots.

28:26.079 --> 28:27.914
I told you just to aggravate them.

28:28.790 --> 28:30.625
[boy 1] Right. Sorry, my bad.

28:30.709 --> 28:34.295
[Seong-je sighs] This is why I never
go on raids with low levels.

28:37.424 --> 28:38.550
Speak.

28:39.342 --> 28:41.970
Well, uh, it's about the phones.

28:42.053 --> 28:44.973
I need until next week to gather
some more, if that's okay.

28:45.056 --> 28:48.727
But after this, I think I'll be able to
bring in a lot more profit continuously.

28:48.810 --> 28:50.353
I'm pretty sure about that.

28:50.437 --> 28:54.023
Also, about what we discussed
about you putting an end to everything

28:54.107 --> 28:56.860
after Park Hu-min returns
from his suspension… [chuckles]

28:56.943 --> 28:57.986
Next week?

28:58.069 --> 29:01.489
Yes, I'll absolutely make sure
that I bring a hundred phones by then.

29:02.031 --> 29:05.118
Wow. Man, I… I never make these mistakes.

29:05.201 --> 29:06.077
[chuckles nervously]

29:06.161 --> 29:08.121
Make sure you have the stuff next week.

29:08.204 --> 29:10.707
[Hyo-man] Of course, man.
My loyalty's with you.

29:10.790 --> 29:13.668
[man 1 chuckles] These high-school punks
are pretty scary, eh?

29:13.752 --> 29:15.378
Kids pretendin' to be gangsters.

29:16.588 --> 29:18.923
The little shits deserve a good beating.

29:19.007 --> 29:19.966
[tuts]

29:21.009 --> 29:23.136
[man 2] Is this kid
a Gen Z gangster or what?

29:23.636 --> 29:25.180
[man 1] Fucking Gen Z punks.

29:28.516 --> 29:31.019
[man 2] Oh great. What do you want?

29:31.102 --> 29:32.771
[groaning]

29:34.439 --> 29:36.441
[moaning]

29:41.571 --> 29:42.864
[yelps]

29:44.657 --> 29:45.492
[scoffs]

29:53.208 --> 29:54.209
Hey.

29:54.876 --> 29:56.878
Seong-je? You must be busy.

29:57.962 --> 29:59.297
Sorry, I'll head out.

30:02.801 --> 30:04.469
What was that prick's name again?

30:06.679 --> 30:08.848
[phone buzzing]

30:11.935 --> 30:16.564
PRESIDENT CHOI

30:16.648 --> 30:18.274
MISSED CALL: PRESIDENT CHOI

30:18.358 --> 30:20.860
VICE PRESIDENT:
LOST YOUR MIND? YOU'RE DEAD

30:20.944 --> 30:22.153
CHOI: SEE YOU TOMORROW LOL

30:22.737 --> 30:24.531
[horn blares]

30:25.156 --> 30:27.158
[phone continues buzzing]

30:32.872 --> 30:34.290
[sighs shakily]

30:38.086 --> 30:39.838
[tense music playing]

30:56.771 --> 30:58.439
[Jun-tae] Newton's third law.

30:59.816 --> 31:01.276
For every action,

31:02.277 --> 31:03.820
there's a reaction

31:04.571 --> 31:08.324
in the same force,
but in the opposite direction.

31:13.663 --> 31:14.914
[lock chimes]

31:19.419 --> 31:20.503
[lock bleeps]

31:21.254 --> 31:22.380
[sighs]

31:25.800 --> 31:27.802
[dynamic music playing]

31:37.395 --> 31:38.938
[straining]

31:43.318 --> 31:44.402
[gasps]

31:45.778 --> 31:47.030
- [sighs]
- [clatters]

31:50.366 --> 31:51.826
[music stops]

31:51.910 --> 31:53.077
[breathing heavily]

31:53.161 --> 31:54.871
[optimistic music playing]

31:56.581 --> 31:57.498
[Jun-tae] Im Han-ul.

31:57.582 --> 31:59.459
CLASS 1, IM HAN-UL
I'M SORRY, LOOK INSIDE

32:01.461 --> 32:03.046
Kwon Ju…

32:05.006 --> 32:05.882
Kwon Ju-ho.

32:07.884 --> 32:09.969
Song Gi-wan, Song Gi-wan.

32:10.053 --> 32:11.262
Song Gi-wan.

32:14.599 --> 32:17.185
Baek Seung-u. Do Jae-gyeong.

32:20.146 --> 32:21.397
Mo Il-yeong.

32:21.481 --> 32:22.523
Hong Seong-gwan.

32:23.066 --> 32:24.067
Seo Jong-ho.

32:24.150 --> 32:26.694
Kwak Byeong-min. Kim Hun-yeong.

32:27.612 --> 32:28.655
Kim Jun-su.

32:32.158 --> 32:35.536
11TH GRADE, CLASS 4
12 - YEON SI-EUN

32:53.596 --> 32:55.264
[boy 1] Stop messing around, bro.

32:55.848 --> 32:58.059
Let me see.
You say you got it back. Show me.

32:58.601 --> 33:01.020
Hey look. Is this your phone?

33:01.104 --> 33:02.188
It's my phone, you idiot.

33:02.271 --> 33:05.024
- [boy 1] You're right.
- [boy 2] God, Jun-tae's lost his mind.

33:05.108 --> 33:07.485
[boy 3] Why's that traitor
suddenly acting like a patriot?

33:07.986 --> 33:11.614
[boy 2] Look. The important thing is
he returned them to everyone, not just me.

33:11.698 --> 33:12.740
I bet he's transferring.

33:12.824 --> 33:14.575
[boy 1] Is Choi Hyo-man at school yet?

33:14.659 --> 33:16.995
Hyo-man gets vicious
when he loses his shit.

33:17.078 --> 33:18.746
Jun-tae is dead for real.

33:29.382 --> 33:32.927
CLASS 4, YEON SI-EUN
I'M SORRY, LOOK INSIDE, THANK YOU

33:55.408 --> 33:57.076
[Hyo-man] Who did you say it was?

33:58.828 --> 33:59.912
[sighs]

34:04.125 --> 34:06.836
Answer me, you goddamn assholes. Who?

34:08.963 --> 34:11.007
[clears throat] It's Seo Jun-tae.

34:11.883 --> 34:13.593
He did class rounds this morning.

34:15.636 --> 34:16.846
[sighs]

34:16.929 --> 34:18.681
[ominous music playing]

34:27.440 --> 34:29.233
[Hyo-man] Move aside, you assholes!

34:36.783 --> 34:38.159
- [boy 1] Shit.
- [boy 2] Oh.

34:38.785 --> 34:40.203
Seo Jun-tae!

34:46.626 --> 34:48.377
Where's that fucking asshole?

34:49.629 --> 34:50.546
Uh, over there.

34:52.965 --> 34:55.927
"For every positive action,
there's a positive reaction that follows."

34:57.303 --> 35:00.223
"For every positive action,
there's a positive reaction that follows."

35:00.306 --> 35:02.475
- [students whispering]
- [Hyo-man] Jun-tae-ya.

35:02.558 --> 35:05.269
"For every positive action,
there's a positive reaction that follows."

35:05.937 --> 35:07.271
[Hyo-man] Come on out.

35:13.486 --> 35:14.987
[breathing heavily]

35:17.240 --> 35:19.659
[Hyo-man scoffs] I'll come to you, then.

35:22.787 --> 35:24.330
- [Hyo-man] Fuckin' asshole!
- [all gasp]

35:24.413 --> 35:26.332
- [boy 3, laughing] Gosh! No way!
- [boy 4] Oh!

35:26.415 --> 35:28.793
- [boy 3] Oh man, he's really hurting.
- [Hyo-man] Hey.

35:28.876 --> 35:29.836
[laughter]

35:29.919 --> 35:31.462
- You did that?
- [boy 3] He's so bad!

35:31.546 --> 35:33.714
Did you really give them all back,
asshole?

35:33.798 --> 35:35.216
[boy 3] It's about to go down.

35:35.299 --> 35:37.802
- [boy 4] He's gotta do something.
- [boy 3] It's about to go down!

35:37.885 --> 35:39.637
[students whooping]

35:39.720 --> 35:40.972
How badass.

35:45.059 --> 35:46.602
[students yelling]

35:46.686 --> 35:48.688
- Fight, come on! Fight!
- You can do it, Jun-tae!

35:48.771 --> 35:50.439
Shit, your guard is freaking sturdy.

35:50.523 --> 35:52.775
- Huh? Hey, that's cool. Huh?
- [boy 5] Let's go, let's go!

35:52.859 --> 35:55.862
- Give it to me. Bro, fucking let go.
- [boy 6] He's fucking sturdy!

35:55.945 --> 35:58.531
- [boy 4] Oh!
- You're a good dancer, puppy Jun-tae!

36:01.742 --> 36:03.327
Try to block this, huh?

36:03.411 --> 36:05.705
- [students gasping]
- [boy 7] Nice shot!

36:05.788 --> 36:07.415
[boy 8] Come on!

36:08.833 --> 36:11.627
- [students calling out]
- [bully 1] A honey hotteok mouth guard!

36:11.711 --> 36:13.296
- [Jun-tae coughing]
- [laughter]

36:13.796 --> 36:15.548
[boy 5] So gross, man.

36:16.299 --> 36:17.758
Oh my gosh.

36:20.052 --> 36:23.014
A little bitch like you should
only do what I say. [laughs]

36:23.097 --> 36:24.182
[boy 3] That's right.

36:24.265 --> 36:26.767
I'm the reason you had
an easy time at school.

36:26.851 --> 36:29.353
Should I make you kill yourself,
you piece of shit?

36:29.437 --> 36:30.521
- [yelps]
- [students gasp]

36:30.605 --> 36:33.232
You son of a bitch.
Huh? You son of a bitch.

36:33.316 --> 36:35.067
Hey! Hey!

36:35.151 --> 36:37.778
- You fucking asshole. You little fucker.
- [groaning]

36:40.031 --> 36:43.284
[Hyo-man] No matter
what kind of fucking shit you do,

36:43.367 --> 36:44.911
nothing will change, you bitch.

36:44.994 --> 36:46.287
Got it?

36:47.330 --> 36:48.789
- [all gasp]
- [Hyo-man] Bitch.

36:48.873 --> 36:49.957
[sounds fade]

36:50.041 --> 36:52.001
[grunting and gasping echoing]

36:52.084 --> 36:54.086
[tense music playing]

37:30.248 --> 37:33.167
- [boy 9] Hey, shouldn't someone stop him?
- Hey, Chief Seo, little buddy.

37:33.251 --> 37:35.253
- [boy 10] Don't get into this.
- We're almost done.

37:35.962 --> 37:37.838
[all] Whoa…

37:39.006 --> 37:41.008
[silence]

37:42.343 --> 37:43.844
[boy 11 chuckles softly]

37:44.345 --> 37:45.763
You're being too loud.

37:49.308 --> 37:50.351
Huh?

37:55.523 --> 37:57.066
Let's not cross the line.

37:57.566 --> 37:59.568
- [all] Ooh!
- [laughter]

38:00.569 --> 38:02.280
[boy 12] What? Whoa!

38:02.363 --> 38:03.572
["Catchy" by SWEAKLOW playing]
